"floor": {"text": "He drops me on the floor of the hallway.", "who": ""},
"hunter": {"text": "Tonight he's the Hunter. The magic takes him; he hunts the white stag, and then he finds the Maiden in the cave.", "who": "Lucien"},
"scent": {"text": "If he'd caught your scent before he found her, it would have been you. He'd have had no say in it.", "who": "Lucien"},
